  "description": "KOGFIY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H115 O25 Sm5,3.5(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, Sm3 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm5 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm1 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.646-5.227 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.53-160.83°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150 H115 O25 Sm5,3.5(C1 H2 Cl2). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
